@startuml "Observer - Price (Solution) - Class Diagram"
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title A feed that tells its listeners
class PriceFeed <<Subject>> {
  - listeners : List<PriceListener>
  + subscribe(PriceListener)
  + unsubscribe(PriceListener)
  + setPrice(int)
}
interface PriceListener <<Observer>> {
  + priceChanged(PriceChange)
}
class PriceChange <<record>> {
  symbol : String
  oldPrice : int
  newPrice : int
}
class Chart <<ConcreteObserver>>
class Ticker <<ConcreteObserver>>
class PriceAlert <<ConcreteObserver>>
PriceFeed o--> "*" PriceListener
PriceListener <|.. Chart
PriceListener <|.. Ticker
PriceListener <|.. PriceAlert
PriceFeed ..> PriceChange : sends
note right of PriceFeed
  <b>Knows only PriceListener.</b>
  Notifies at the moment of the change,
  so no change is missed.
end note
@enduml
